# The suites parse the HTML with LF-anchored regexes (reflux_checks.cjs
# matches "*/\n" when pulling the scoped CSS blocks), and reflux_mutate.sh is a
# bash script. A CRLF checkout breaks both, so pin every text file to LF
# regardless of platform or the user's core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf
